==German==

===Etymology===
By renewed adaption to {{m|de|Beere}} from earlier and still dialectal {{m|de|Himper}}, by assimilation (as in {{m|de|Wimper}}) from {{inh|de|gmh|hintber}}, from {{inh|de|goh|hintberi}}, derived from {{compound|goh|hinta|beri|gloss1=hind, doe|gloss2=berry|nocat=1}}

